<title>USA: Heartland Wireless says names Carroll McHenry CEO.</title>
<headline>Heartland Wireless says names Carroll McHenry CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heartland Wireless Communications Inc said Thursday it named Carroll McHenry president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The company said he replaces John Fanning, who has been serving as interim CEO.</p>
<p>The company said McHenry has been a senior executive at ALLTEL Corp for the past five years.</p>
